{"candidateAnswer":"Pixie was adopted by Audrey between 27 March 2023 and 2 April 2023. Audrey had her other three dogs for 3 years as of 27 March 2023. Therefore, Pixie was adopted about 3 years after the other three dogs.","evidence":"[D2:1 | 2:42 pm on 2 April, 2023] Audrey: Hey Andrew, I got a surprise for you! We adopted another puppy called Pixie. She's SO cute! Isn't she just the cutest?\n[D1:7 | 1:10 pm on 27 March, 2023] Audrey: I've had them for 3 years! Their names are Pepper, Precious and Panda. I can't live without my little ones!","itemId":"urn:uuid:25a37662-13a3-5b7b-b372-47b4ea7c9162","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:528d047d8b6ea357e223af25cd747de77cee798c0be74879d8235edc0586a82f","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How many years passed between Audrey adopting Pixie and her other three dogs?","referenceAnswer":"three years","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"528d047d8b6ea357e223af25cd747de77cee798c0be74879d8235edc0586a82f"}}]}